       </div>
       <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-cyan-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
         <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707" />
         </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-orbitron font-bold mb-2">Încărcare</h4>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">DC Fast Charging până la 200 kW, 10-80% în 31 minute</p>
